<title>FINLAND: ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP MEDAL ROUND STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP MEDAL ROUND STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>World championship medal round standings on Monday:</p>
<p>			   P   W  D  L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> 1. Russia	     3   2  0  1  11  10    4</p>
<p> 2. Sweden	     3   2  0  1  11   7    4</p>
<p> 3. Finland	    2   1  0  1   8   6    2</p>
<p> 4. Canada	     2   1  0  1   7   8    2</p>
<p> 5. United States    3   1  0  2   6  11    2</p>
<p> 6. Czech Republic   3   1  0  2   7   8    2</p>
<p>Russia lead Sweden and the U.S. lead the Czech Republic despite weaker goal differences because Russia have beaten Sweden and the U.S. have beaten the Czechs</p>
<p>Next matches: Finland v Canada, Russia v United States (Tuesday)</p>
</text>
